WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:07.416
If your money is scattered across brokerages, retirement accounts, and the bank—you're not alone.

2
00:00:07.966 --> 00:00:13.126
Sampatti brings it all into one private picture, on your own computer.

3
00:00:13.676 --> 00:00:16.436
No cloud, no sign-up.

4
00:00:16.986 --> 00:00:20.970
Let's choose the United States and explore the demo.

5
00:00:22.570 --> 00:00:25.210
This is your financial home.

6
00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:29.912
You see your total net worth and allocation at a glance.

7
00:00:30.462 --> 00:00:39.318
These verdicts on concentration and liquidity aren't generic advice—they're deterministic reads computed entirely on your device.

8
00:00:40.918 --> 00:00:46.174
The Performance tab answers the big question: is your wealth actually growing?

9
00:00:46.724 --> 00:00:55.196
Zoom into any period to see your net worth history stacked by account—built from your real cost basis, never estimates.

10
00:00:56.796 --> 00:01:00.132
The Holdings tab gives you total control.

11
00:01:00.682 --> 00:01:07.186
Edit positions, refresh prices, or exclude an account from your dashboard in seconds.

12
00:01:07.736 --> 00:01:12.848
To add your own data, just drop in an export from Schwab or Fidelity.

13
00:01:13.398 --> 00:01:20.046
It parses locally, and you review everything in a secure card before it touches your portfolio.

14
00:01:21.646 --> 00:01:25.414
For a deeper look, use the AI Analyst.

15
00:01:25.964 --> 00:01:31.844
It reviews your 401(k) placement, wash sales, and capital gains.

16
00:01:32.394 --> 00:01:38.706
You can read the exact summary before it leaves for analysis—privacy is the through-line.

17
00:01:40.306 --> 00:01:44.410
In Settings, you can configure the AI Analyst.

18
00:01:44.960 --> 00:01:49.760
Just paste your secure access code to connect to the hosted relay.

19
00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:55.662
Your data stays on your device—only the compact brief is sent for review.

20
00:01:57.262 --> 00:02:00.862
The Privacy page is our absolute promise.

21
00:02:01.412 --> 00:02:06.692
Export everything as a single file, or erase it all with one click.

22
00:02:07.242 --> 00:02:11.202
In Sampatti, your financial life stays yours.

23
00:02:12.802 --> 00:02:14.890
That's Sampatti.

24
00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:18.632
The private way to see your whole net worth.

25
00:02:19.182 --> 00:02:22.470
Download it free tonight and meet your money.
